## ⚙️ System Architecture & Audit Workflow

The auditor operates on a strict **4-Layer Screening Engine** to ensure zero-risk date selection:

```
                  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
                  │    Batch Candidate Dates (20+ Dates)    │
                  └────────────────────┬─────────────────────┘
                                       │
                                       ▼
 ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │ LAYER 1: HARD ELIMINATIONS (Automatic Rejection)                         │
 │ - House Sitting 180° Clashes & 24-Mountain Animal Clashes                 │
 │ - Annual & Monthly 3 Killings (San Sha) / Monthly 5 Yellow               │
 │ - Personal Zodiac Year Breakers (Sui Po)                                  │
 │ - Universal Red Flags (Yang Gong Days, Eclipses, Destruction/Close Days) │
 └────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                                       │ (Surviving Dates Only)
                                       ▼
 ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │ LAYER 2: ELEMENTAL & EVENT MATCHING                                       │
 │ - Fire Activation: Requires Wood/Fire Na Yin (Avoid Water)               │
 │ - Metal Placement: Requires Earth/Metal Na Yin (Avoid Fire)               │
 └────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                                       │
                                       ▼
 ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │ LAYER 3: DAY OFFICER HIERARCHY & NOBLE OVERRIDES                         │
 │ - Primary "Good Days" (Success, Open, Stable, Initiate, Remove) → Tier 1/2│
 │ - Secondary Days (Establish, Full, Receive) → Restricted to Tier 3 Backup │
 │ - Great Sun (Tai Yang) / Great Moon (Tai Yin) Override Logic applied      │
 └────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                                       │
                                       ▼
                  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
                  │ Final Tiered Client Recommendation List │
                  └──────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

For the complete technical rulebook, see [`docs/SOP_Date_Selection_Rules.md`](./docs/SOP_Date_Selection_Rules.md).
